{"seq":2,"slug":"leadership-theories","title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 领导力理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/leadership-theories","wordCount":2263,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-组织行为学-领导力理论\">研究生 组织行为学 — 领导力理论</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>领导力研究是组织行为学中积累最丰富、也最具学科交叉性的领域之一。从早期的特质论和行为论到变革型领导、仆人式领导、真实性领导和共享领导等当代理论，领导力研究的理论光谱持续拓展。对于管理学研究生而言，系统掌握领导力理论的演进脉络和实证基础，是开展领导力相关研究、理解组织效能和参与管理实践的重要前提。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>特质与行为取向</strong>：领导者特质元分析、Ohio State 二维模型、Blake-Mouton 管理方格</li>\n<li><strong>权变理论</strong>：Fiedler 权变模型、情境领导理论、路径-目标理论、领导者-成员交换（LMX）</li>\n<li><strong>变革型与交易型领导</strong>：Burns 的概念框架、Bass 的全范围领导模型</li>\n<li><strong>新兴领导力理论</strong>：仆人式领导、真实性领导、伦理型领导、谦逊型领导</li>\n<li><strong>共享领导与集体领导</strong>：去中心化的领导过程</li>\n<li><strong>暗面领导</strong>：辱虐式管理、自恋型领导、放任型领导</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"从特质到行为-领导力研究的早期脉络\">从特质到行为：领导力研究的早期脉络</h3><p>领导力研究始于 20 世纪初的&quot;伟人理论&quot;——试图发现将领导者与非领导者区分开的内在特质。早期研究因缺乏一致性结论而一度被宣判&quot;死刑&quot;，但 Judge 等人（2002）的大规模元分析重新证实了人格特质的预测价值。研究发现，大五人格中的外向性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.31</span></span></span></span></span>）和尽责性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.28</span></span></span></span></span>）与领导力涌现最相关，而智力与领导力有效性的相关为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.27</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>20 世纪 50 年代，Ohio State 大学的领导行为研究识别了两个核心维度：<strong>关怀型行为</strong>（Consideration）——关注下属情感需求和人际关系；<strong>任务导向行为</strong>（Initiating Structure）——关注目标设定、角色明确和绩效标准。这一二维框架至今仍是领导行为测量的基础。DeRue 等人（2011）的元分析显示，关怀行为与下属满意度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.46</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span></span></span></span></span>）和领导有效性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span></span></span></span></span>）强相关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"权变理论-情境的核心地位\">权变理论：情境的核心地位</h3><p>权变理论认为没有普遍最优的领导风格，有效的领导取决于领导者特征与情境变量的匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>Fiedler 权变模型</strong>通过&quot;最不喜欢的同事&quot;量表（LPC）将领导者分为任务导向型和关系导向型，然后根据领导者-成员关系、任务结构和职位权力三个情境变量判断最适合的领导风格。尽管 LPC 测量的构念效度存在争议，但该模型开创了领导力权变研究的先河。</p>\n<p>**领导者-成员交换理论（LMX）**是权变理论中影响最持久的框架之一。LMX 理论认为领导者不是对所有下属采用统一风格，而是与不同下属建立差异化的交换关系。高质量 LMX 关系（&quot;圈内人&quot;）以信任、尊重和互惠义务为特征，与更高的工作满意度、绩效和组织公民行为相关。Gerstner 和 Day（1997）的元分析发现，LMX 质量与下属绩效的相关为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span></span></span></span></span>，与满意度的相关为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>近年来 LMX 研究的前沿包括：LMX 分化（团队内 LMX 差异）对团队公平感和凝聚力的影响；LMX 关系的动态发展过程；以及双向视角——下属如何主动塑造 LMX 质量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变革型领导-范式转换\">变革型领导：范式转换</h3><p>Burns（1978）在政治领导力研究中区分了交易型领导（通过资源交换实现目标）和变革型领导（通过激发下属的高层需求实现超越性目标）。Bass（1985）将这一概念引入组织行为学，提出全范围领导模型（Full Range Leadership Model），包含：</p>\n<p><strong>变革型领导四维度（4I&#39;s）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理想化影响（Idealized Influence）：作为道德楷模和角色榜样</li>\n<li>鼓舞型激励（Inspirational Motivation）：阐述愿景并激发共同使命感</li>\n<li>智力激发（Intellectual Stimulation）：挑战现状、鼓励创新思维</li>\n<li>个性化关怀（Individualized Consideration）：关注每位下属的独特发展需求</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>交易型领导</strong>：权变奖励（绩效-回报交换）和例外管理（主动和被动监控偏差）</p>\n<p><strong>放任型领导（Laissez-Faire）</strong>：缺乏领导行为，被视为最低效的领导形态</p>\n<p>Judge 和 Piccolo（2004）的元分析显示，变革型领导与多种有效性指标强相关：下属满意度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.58</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.58</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.58</span></span></span></span></span>）、领导者有效性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.64</span></span></span></span></span>）和群体绩效（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span></span></span></span></span>）。值得注意的是，权变奖励（交易型）也表现出较高的有效性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.39</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.39</span></span></span></span></span>），挑战了&quot;变革型全面优于交易型&quot;的简单叙事。</p>\n<h3 id=\"当代领导力理论群\">当代领导力理论群</h3><p><strong>仆人式领导（Servant Leadership）</strong>：Greenleaf 提出的理念，强调领导者首先是服务者，以下属成长和社区福祉为核心目标。Eva 等人（2019）的元分析发现仆人式领导与组织公民行为（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.33</span></span></span></span></span>）和工作绩效（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.21</span></span></span></span></span>）正相关。</p>\n<p><strong>真实性领导（Authentic Leadership）</strong>：强调领导者的自我意识、关系透明、内化道德和平衡信息处理。该理论在安然丑闻等企业伦理危机后兴起，回应了&quot;道德领导力&quot;的呼唤。</p>\n<p><strong>伦理型领导（Ethical Leadership）</strong>：Brown 等人（2005）定义为&quot;通过个人行为和人际互动展示规范性适当行为，并通过双向沟通、强化和决策向下属推广此类行为&quot;。伦理型领导通过社会学习机制影响下属的道德行为。</p>\n<p><strong>共享领导（Shared Leadership）</strong>：将领导力从个体层面推向团队层面，认为领导功能可以由多个团队成员分担。在知识密集型团队中，共享领导与团队绩效的关联可能强于垂直领导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"领导力的暗面\">领导力的暗面</h3><p><strong>辱虐式管理（Abusive Supervision）</strong>：Tepper（2000）定义为&quot;下属对上司持续展示敌意言语和非言语行为（不包括身体接触）的感知&quot;。元分析显示其与反生产行为（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.42</span></span></span></span></span>）和心理困扰（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.36</span></span></span></span></span>）强正相关。辱虐式管理的前因包括领导者自身承受的压力和攻击性人格特质。</p>\n<p>领导力暗面研究提醒我们，领导力理论不应仅关注&quot;好领导是什么样&quot;，还需理解&quot;坏领导如何产生、如何传播、如何遏制&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>理论整合</strong>：变革型领导和仆人式领导在核心理念上有何异同？它们是互补关系还是竞争关系？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>实证评价</strong>：LMX 理论的核心命题是领导者与不同下属建立差异化关系。请讨论 LMX 分化可能带来的积极和消极组织效果。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>研究设计</strong>：设计一项多来源研究，检验伦理型领导对员工亲组织非伦理行为（pro-organizational unethical behavior）的影响。请说明数据来源设计和避免共同方法偏差的策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>批判性分析</strong>：有学者批评领导力研究存在&quot;浪漫化&quot;倾向——高估领导者对组织结果的因果影响。你如何评价这一批评？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>中国情境</strong>：家长式领导（Paternalistic Leadership）是华人组织中的重要领导形态。请比较家长式领导（威权、仁慈、德行三维度）与变革型领导的理论假设差异。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>元分析里程碑</strong>：Judge, T. A., &amp; Piccolo, R. F. (2004). Transformational and transactional leadership: A meta-analytic test of their relative validity. <em>Journal of Applied Psychology, 89</em>(5), 755-768.</li>\n<li><strong>LMX 综合</strong>：Graen, G. B., &amp; Uhl-Bien, M. (1995). Relationship-based approach to leadership. <em>The Leadership Quarterly, 6</em>(2), 219-247.</li>\n<li><strong>仆人式领导元分析</strong>：Eva, N., Robin, M., Sendjaya, S., van Dierendonck, D., &amp; Liden, R. C. (2019). Servant leadership: A systematic review and call for future research. <em>The Leadership Quarterly, 30</em>(1), 111-132.</li>\n<li><strong>辱虐式管理</strong>：Tepper, B. J. (2007). Abusive supervision in work organizations. <em>Journal of Management, 33</em>(3), 261-289.</li>\n<li><strong>中国领导力</strong>：Chen, X. P., Eberly, M. B., Chiang, T. J., Farh, J. L., &amp; Cheng, B. S. (2014). Affective trust in Chinese leaders: Linking paternalistic leadership to employee performance. <em>Journal of Management, 40</em>(3), 796-819.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>领导力研究从特质论出发，经历行为论、权变论和变革型领导的范式转换，如今已形成多元并存的理论格局。研究生应避免在众多理论间简单选择&quot;最好的&quot;，而是理解每种理论回答的是不同的问题、适用于不同的情境。特别值得关注的是领导力研究的方法论挑战：因果推断的困难、共同方法偏差的威胁、以及跨层次效应的复杂性。建议深入一个具体的领导力理论，掌握其测量工具和实证范式，再拓展到跨理论的对话。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 组织行为学 — 领导力理论","id":"研究生-组织行为学-领导力理论"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"从特质到行为：领导力研究的早期脉络","id":"从特质到行为-领导力研究的早期脉络"},{"level":3,"text":"权变理论：情境的核心地位","id":"权变理论-情境的核心地位"},{"level":3,"text":"变革型领导：范式转换","id":"变革型领导-范式转换"},{"level":3,"text":"当代领导力理论群","id":"当代领导力理论群"},{"level":3,"text":"领导力的暗面","id":"领导力的暗面"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 团队动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/team-dynamics"},"next":{"title":"研究生 组织行为学 — 冲突与谈判","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/management/organizational-behavior-grad/group/conflict-negotiation"}}